/* 视觉规范 v1：表单白卡（左右 16），每行"标签 80 + 输入"，行高 52，分割线左缩进 16；卡间 12 */
.editor-page { padding: var(--xy-space-3) var(--xy-layout-page-padding-x) var(--xy-space-6); color: var(--xy-color-text-primary); }
.editor-card { overflow: hidden; padding: 0 var(--xy-space-4); border-radius: var(--xy-radius-lg); background: var(--xy-color-surface); }
.editor-card + .editor-card { margin-top: var(--xy-space-3); }
.field-label { display: block; flex: 0 0 80px; color: var(--xy-color-text-primary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.contact-field { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; min-height: 52px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: var(--xy-space-4) 0; }
.contact-field + .contact-field { border-top: 1px solid var(--xy-color-divider); }
.contact-field input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); margin: 0; color: var(--xy-color-text-primary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.contact-field .field-error, .detail-field .field-error { width: 100%; margin: var(--xy-space-1) 0 0 calc(var(--xy-space-4) * 5); }
.region-row { display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: 52px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: var(--xy-space-4) 0; }
.region-row:active { background: var(--xy-color-surface-subtle); }
.region-row .picker-value { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.picker-value { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--xy-space-2); color: var(--xy-color-text-primary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.picker-value > text:first-child { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.picker-value > text:last-child { flex: 0 0 16px; color: var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size: var(--xy-text-section-title-size); text-align: right; }
.detail-field { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: var(--xy-space-4) 0 var(--xy-space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--xy-color-divider); }
.detail-field textarea { flex: 1; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; height: 64px; color: var(--xy-color-text-primary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.field-count { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: var(--xy-space-1); color: var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size: var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); text-align: right; }
.default-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--xy-space-3); min-height: 52px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: var(--xy-space-3); padding: var(--xy-space-3) var(--xy-space-4); border-radius: var(--xy-radius-lg); background: var(--xy-color-surface); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.switch { flex: none; width: 44px; height: 24px; padding: var(--xy-gap-label-value-compact); box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: var(--xy-radius-pill); background: var(--xy-color-border); transition: background var(--xy-duration-normal) ease; }
.switch > view { width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--xy-color-surface); box-shadow: var(--xy-shadow-segment); transition: margin-left var(--xy-duration-normal) ease; }
.switch.is-on { background: var(--xy-color-brand); }
.switch.is-on > view { margin-left: var(--xy-space-5); }
.form-error, .field-error { display: block; color: var(--xy-color-danger); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.form-error { margin-top: var(--xy-space-3); padding: 0; }
.editor-actions { display: flex; gap: var(--xy-space-2); }
.save-primary, .save-secondary { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: var(--xy-size-touch-min); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0 var(--xy-space-3); border-radius: var(--xy-radius-md); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.save-primary::after, .save-secondary::after { border: 0; }
.save-primary { flex: 1 1 120px; min-width: 120px; background: var(--xy-color-brand); color: var(--xy-color-text-inverse); }
.save-primary:active { background: var(--xy-color-brand-pressed); }
.save-secondary { flex: 0 0 104px; border: 1px solid var(--xy-color-border); background: var(--xy-color-surface); color: var(--xy-color-text-primary); }
.region-tabs { display: flex; gap: var(--xy-space-6); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--xy-color-divider); }
.region-tab { position: relative; padding: var(--xy-space-3) 0; color: var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-medium); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.region-tab.is-active { color: var(--xy-color-text-strong); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-bold); box-shadow: inset 0 -2px var(--xy-color-brand); }
.region-options { padding-top: var(--xy-space-2); }
.region-option { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; min-height: var(--xy-size-touch-min); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.region-option.is-active { color: var(--xy-color-brand); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.touch-overlay { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 100% !important; height: 100%; min-width: var(--xy-size-touch-min); min-height: var(--xy-size-touch-min); transform: translate(-50%,-50%); box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0; margin: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: transparent; }
.touch-overlay::after { border: 0; }
